  ]
 },
 {
  "kind": "text",
  "prefix": "",
  "lines": [
   {
    "text": "Photosynthesis is the process by which green plants make their own",
    "box": [
     120,
     491.828125,
     1043.515625,
     528.828125
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "food. They use light energy from the sun, water from the soil and carbon",
    "box": [
     120,
     540.09375,
     1107.328125,
     577.09375
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "dioxide from the air. The food made is glucose, and oxygen is given off.",
    "box": [
